S1 aborted at block 5: the environment did not return to the calibrated band
(1.49-2.70 ms) within 300s / 15 probes (hit the time cap). Per the frozen
protocol the run stops here rather than continuing on an unstable box or
widening the band. Keep this partial file for the record and report the abort.
